 • \`/shutdown\` — Stop pi (restarts into a fresh session under systemd)
 • \`/new <title>\` — Start a fresh session room (bot invites you; the conversation continues there)
 
+*pi session (DM only — these run without a model turn):*
+• \`/model [query]\` — List models, or switch: \`/model glm-5.3-flash\`
+• \`/compact [instructions]\` — Compact the context now
+• \`/thinking <level>\` — off|minimal|low|medium|high|xhigh
+• \`/name <name>\` — Name this session (shown in session lists)
+• \`!<command>\` — Run a shell command directly (last 50 lines come back; no model turn, not sent to the model)
+
+The room topic tracks live status: \`🤖 model · ctx used/max · cwd\`.
+
 *Any authorized user:*
 • \`stop\` — Interrupt the current turn (also \`/stop\` or \`!stop\`)
 
